       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. DIVREM2.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-DIVIDEND   PIC S9(4)V99 VALUE -10.00.
       01 WS-DIVISOR    PIC S9(4)V99 VALUE 3.00.
       01 WS-QUOT       PIC S9(4)V99.
       01 WS-REM        PIC S9(4)V99.
       01 WS-DIVIDEND2  PIC S9(4)V99 VALUE 10.00.
       01 WS-DIVISOR2   PIC S9(4)V99 VALUE -3.00.
       01 WS-QUOT2      PIC S9(4)V9(4).
       01 WS-REM2       PIC S9(4)V99.
       01 WS-DIVIDEND3  PIC S9(4)V99 VALUE -10.00.
       01 WS-DIVISOR3   PIC S9(4)V99 VALUE -3.00.
       01 WS-QUOT3      PIC S9(4).
       01 WS-REM3       PIC S9(4)V99.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           DIVIDE WS-DIVIDEND BY WS-DIVISOR
               GIVING WS-QUOT REMAINDER WS-REM.
           DISPLAY "Q=" WS-QUOT " R=" WS-REM.
           DIVIDE WS-DIVIDEND2 BY WS-DIVISOR2
               GIVING WS-QUOT2 REMAINDER WS-REM2.
           DISPLAY "Q2=" WS-QUOT2 " R2=" WS-REM2.
           DIVIDE WS-DIVIDEND3 BY WS-DIVISOR3
               GIVING WS-QUOT3 REMAINDER WS-REM3.
           DISPLAY "Q3=" WS-QUOT3 " R3=" WS-REM3.
           STOP RUN.
